[109.547941, "o", "AI inventory: 16 AI assets (9 managed, 7 self-hosted)\r\n\r\nManaged\r\n  sanctioned   AWS::Bedrock::Guardrail            tsghelpdesk01  (owner: platform)\r\n  sanctioned   AWS::Bedrock::KnowledgeBase        KBHELPDESK1  (owner: platform)\r\n  sanctioned   AWS::Bedrock::DataSource           DSHELPDESK1  (owner: platform)\r\n"]
[109.548194, "o", "  sanctioned   AWS::BedrockAgentCore::Runtime     tsg_helpdesk-AbCdEf1234  (owner: platform)\r\n  sanctioned   AWS::BedrockAgentCore::Gateway     tsg-helpdesk-gw-a1b2c3d4e5  (owner: platform)\r\n  sanctioned   AWS::BedrockAgentCore::Memory      tsg_helpdesk_mem-Xy12Ab34Cd  (owner: platform)\r\n  UNSANCTIONED AWS::BedrockAgentCore::Runtime     marketing_poc_agent-Zz98Yy76Xx  (owner: marketing)\r\n  sanctioned   AWS::SageMaker::Endpoint           churn-model-prod  (owner: data-science)\r\n  UNSANCTIONED AWS::SageMaker::NotebookInstance   ds-scratch-notebook  (owner: (no owner tag))\r\n\r\nSelfHosted\r\n  UNSANCTIONED SelfHosted::AI::InferenceEndpoint  inference-endpoint/ollama on i-0a1b2c3d4e5f60002  (owner: data-science)\r\n  UNSANCTIONED SelfHosted::AI::InferenceEndpoint  inference-endpoint/vllm on i-0a1b2c3d4e5f60002  (owner: data-science)\r\n  UNSANCTIONED SelfHosted::AI::Model              model/Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on i-0a1b2c3d4e5f60002  (owner: data-science)\r\n  UNSANCTIONED SelfHosted::AI::Model              model/llama3.2:3b on i-0a1b2c3d4e5f60002  (owner: data-science)\r\n  UNSANCTIONED SelfHosted::AI::Agent              agent/openclaw on i-0a1b2c3d4e5f60003  (owner: it)\r\n  UNSANCTIONED SelfHosted::AI::ExternalEndpoint   api.anthropic.com on i-0a1b2c3d4e5f60003  (owner: it)\r\n  UNSANCTIONED SelfHosted::AI::ExternalEndpoint   api.openai.com on i-0a1b2c3d4e5f60001  (owner: finance)\r\n\r\nNot attributed: 9 DNS queries to api.mistral.ai from 10.20.9.44, which is not an EC2 instance. Security Hub doesn't attribute Lambda, Fargate, EKS or SageMaker calls: find the owner of that address yourself (VPC flow logs, ENI description).\r\nYour check: ollama on i-0a1b2c3d4e5f60002 listens on port 11434 and its security group allows 0.0.0.0/0. Self-hosted AI resources have no Security Hub findings in this release.\r\n\r\n9 of 16 AI assets are not on the approved register.\r\n"]
