[123.510353, "o", "Posture of the first-draft setup\r\n\r\nAWS managed rules (AWS Config; Security Hub CSPM control in brackets)\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrockagentcore-runtime-private-network-required       [BedrockAgentCore.1]  tsg_helpdesk-AbCdEf1234  NetworkMode\r\n  COMPLIANT     bedrockagentcore-gateway-authorizer-enabled             [BedrockAgentCore.2]  tsg-helpdesk-gw-a1b2c3d4e5  \r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrockagentcore-gateway-authorizer-enabled             [BedrockAgentCore.2]  marketing-poc-gw-Qq11Ww22Ee  Authori\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrock-agentcore-memory-encryption-enabled             [BedrockAgentCore.3]  tsg_helpdesk_mem-Xy12Ab34Cd  no Encr\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrockagentcore-gateway-encryption-enabled             [BedrockAgentCore.4]  tsg-helpdesk-gw-a1b2c3d4e5  no KmsKe\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrockagentcore-gateway-encryption-enabled             [BedrockAgentCore.4]  marketing-poc-gw-Qq11Ww22Ee  no KmsK\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrockagentcore-browsercustom-network-mode-not-public  [BedrockAgentCore.5]  tsg_browser-Ll77Kk88Jj  NetworkMode \r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrockagentcore-browsercustom-recording-enabled        [BedrockAgentCore.6]  tsg_browser-Ll77Kk88Jj  recording di\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrockagentcore-codeinterpreter-networkmode-check      [BedrockAgentCore.7]  tsg_ci-Pp55Oo66Ii  NetworkMode SANDB\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrock-agentcore-memory-event-expiry-duration          [Config only]         tsg_helpdesk_mem-Xy12Ab34Cd  EventEx\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT bedrock-data-source-encryption-enabled                  [Bedrock.1]           DSHELPDESK1  no ServerSideEncryption\r\n\r\nCustom rules (no AWS managed rule: you write these)\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT C01 Bedrock model invocation logging on, text, with an S3 location for large data  model invocation logging is off\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT C02 GuardDuty AI Protection enabled  AI_PROTECTION DISABLED\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT C03 An account-enforced guardrail with a prompt attack filter  no account-enforced guardrail: GuardDuty's PromptIn\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT C04 Trail data events for bedrock-mantle and AgentCore Runtime and Gateway  no data event selector for AWS::Bedroc\r\n  NON_COMPLIANT C05 Every gateway with a policy engine runs it in ENFORCE  policy engine in LOG_ONLY on tsg-helpdesk-gw-a1b2c3d4e5\r\n\r\n15 NON_COMPLIANT of 16 evaluations\r\n"]
